ontent is good, emphasise that consistency and volume matter more than any single post.\n\n---\n\nSCORING — 5 categories, each scored 0-100:\n\n1. Hook & Retention — Does the opening 1-3 seconds stop the scroll? Is there a reason to keep watching? Would someone who does not follow this creator stop for this? Does the hook earn the right to the next second?\n\n2. Content Value — Did the viewer get something worth their time: learning, entertainment, inspiration, connection, relatability? Would someone save this or share it? Is this content generous or surface-level? Could the viewer actually do or understand something after watching?\n\n3. Audience Connection — Does the creator make the viewer feel seen, understood, or entertained? Is there personality coming through? Does the creator have a point of view, or could anyone have made this? Would this make someone want to follow for more?\n\n4. Creative Execution — Is the format used well? Are transitions, text overlays, music, or effects adding to the content or distracting from it? Is the pacing right for the content type? Is the video the right length: long enough to deliver value, short enough to keep attention?\n\n5. Technical Quality — Audio clarity, lighting, camera work. Is the video watchable? Does the caption enhance the video (add context, create curiosity, prompt engagement) or is it generic and wasted?\n\n---\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No text before or after.\n\n{\n  \"verification_status\": \"Approved, Rejected, or Pending\",\n  \"ai_confidence_score\": \"0-100\",\n  \"rejection_reason\": \"null OR one of: Wrong content type, Low quality video, Reposted content, Suspicious content, Other\",\n  \"concept_name\": \"short descriptive name for this review, max 5 words\",\n  \"content_summary\": \"2-3 sentence description of what the video shows\",\n  \"content_type_observed\": \"Educational, Entertainment, Lifestyle, Storytelling, Tutorial, Opinion, or Mixed\",\n  \"overall_score\": \"0-100 — average of score